1
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:52,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 9]</font>

15
00:01:18,240 --> 00:01:19,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness, please speak quickly.</font>

16
00:01:19,560 --> 00:01:21,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Chief is waiting for me
to investigate the case.</font>

17
00:01:22,160 --> 00:01:23,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I believe you must know</font>

18
00:01:24,160 --> 00:01:25,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jinyi is only pretending to be mad.</font>

19
00:01:27,920 --> 00:01:29,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But her hair...</font>

20
00:01:31,120 --> 00:01:32,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She took a large number
of Weakening Pills.</font>

21
00:01:33,160 --> 00:01:34,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It damaged her foundation.</font>

22
00:01:35,880 --> 00:01:37,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's why she ended up like this.</font>

23
00:01:37,680 --> 00:01:38,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's been this way since childhood,</font>

24
00:01:39,520 --> 00:01:40,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">always putting you first.</font>

25
00:01:41,600 --> 00:01:42,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To protect you,</font>

26
00:01:43,440 --> 00:01:45,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she even sacrificed her looks,
a woman's most treasured asset.</font>

27
00:01:46,240 --> 00:01:47,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When she was little,</font>

28
00:01:48,280 --> 00:01:49,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my father took pity on her</font>

29
00:01:49,320 --> 00:01:50,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and took her in.</font>

30
00:01:50,920 --> 00:01:51,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To repay that kindness,</font>

31
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:53,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she trained hard to keep me safe.</font>

32
00:01:54,680 --> 00:01:55,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All these years,</font>

33
00:01:55,720 --> 00:01:57,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she has been utterly loyal to me.</font>

34
00:01:58,440 --> 00:01:59,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, I believe,</font>

35
00:02:00,360 --> 00:02:01,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">no matter what happens now,</font>

36
00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:03,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I must protect her.</font>

37
00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:07,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two are childhood sweethearts,</font>

38
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:08,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">growing up together.</font>

39
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:09,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What does that have to do with me?</font>

40
00:02:10,920 --> 00:02:11,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The rumors started because of me.</font>

41
00:02:12,640 --> 00:02:14,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll fix the trouble I caused.</font>

42
00:02:16,200 --> 00:02:17,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even if you hadn't said all this,</font>

43
00:02:18,240 --> 00:02:20,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I would still do my utmost
to uncover the truth.</font>

44
00:02:20,600 --> 00:02:21,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The rumors will then collapse
on their own.</font>

45
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:24,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I must trouble you, dear.</font>

46
00:02:25,840 --> 00:02:27,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't try to cozy up to me.</font>

47
00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:29,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once this case is closed,
you must give me a divorce letter</font>

48
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:30,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and grant me my freedom.</font>

49
00:03:04,920 --> 00:03:05,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You still won't talk, huh?</font>

50
00:03:07,320 --> 00:03:08,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A tongue is meant for speaking.</font>

51
00:03:09,600 --> 00:03:10,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you refuse to speak again,</font>

52
00:03:11,880 --> 00:03:12,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you won't need to keep it.</font>

53
00:03:13,480 --> 00:03:13,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

54
00:03:20,040 --> 00:03:20,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll talk.</font>

55
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:21,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll talk.</font>

56
00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:24,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was Eunuch Fuhai
from Princess Changle's Mansion.</font>

57
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:26,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He paid a hefty sum</font>

58
00:03:26,520 --> 00:03:27,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and had us spread</font>

59
00:03:27,440 --> 00:03:29,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the rumor that you drink blood.</font>

60
00:03:29,640 --> 00:03:30,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The more outrageous we made it,</font>

61
00:03:31,080 --> 00:03:32,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the more money they offered.</font>

62
00:03:33,400 --> 00:03:34,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My eyes</font>

63
00:03:35,240 --> 00:03:37,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">were completely blinded by greed.</font>

64
00:03:38,200 --> 00:03:39,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please, spare my life!</font>

65
00:03:40,280 --> 00:03:42,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Would you like to atone for your crimes?</font>

66
00:03:42,040 --> 00:03:42,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

67
00:03:43,200 --> 00:03:44,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, Your Highness!</font>

68
00:03:46,640 --> 00:03:48,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have the men search again, thoroughly.</font>

69
00:03:48,520 --> 00:03:48,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Understood.</font>

70
00:03:51,880 --> 00:03:52,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

71
00:03:53,080 --> 00:03:53,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Any leads yet?</font>

72
00:03:54,840 --> 00:03:56,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I had our men check the rear courtyard</font>

73
00:03:56,320 --> 00:03:57,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the front courtyard</font>

74
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:58,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of Prince Duan's Mansion.</font>

75
00:03:58,560 --> 00:04:00,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We found no place
that could be linked to the crime.</font>

76
00:04:01,760 --> 00:04:02,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can that be?</font>

77
00:04:03,840 --> 00:04:05,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The killer struck in the dead of night.</font>

78
00:04:06,040 --> 00:04:07,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From the rear courtyard
to the Prince's quarters,</font>

79
00:04:07,440 --> 00:04:08,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's only a short path.</font>

80
00:04:09,480 --> 00:04:11,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could they kill
without making a sound?</font>

81
00:04:12,120 --> 00:04:13,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All along this route,</font>

82
00:04:13,360 --> 00:04:14,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we haven't found any bloodstains.</font>

83
00:04:17,920 --> 00:04:19,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Blood...</font>

84
00:04:20,320 --> 00:04:20,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

85
00:04:21,400 --> 00:04:22,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's a method we can try.</font>

86
00:04:22,760 --> 00:04:23,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What method?</font>

87
00:04:25,760 --> 00:04:26,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

88
00:04:26,520 --> 00:04:27,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

89
00:04:28,200 --> 00:04:29,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief, look.</font>

90
00:04:31,280 --> 00:04:32,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is that awful smell?</font>

91
00:04:33,320 --> 00:04:35,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I went to the latrine specifically</font>

92
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:36,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to catch these little treasures.</font>

93
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:37,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The latrine?</font>

94
00:04:41,880 --> 00:04:43,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did you catch so many flies?</font>

95
00:04:44,960 --> 00:04:45,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just wait.</font>

96
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:06,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right here.</font>

97
00:05:07,520 --> 00:05:08,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Flies are drawn to the scent of blood.</font>

98
00:05:09,320 --> 00:05:10,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They've landed here,</font>

99
00:05:10,680 --> 00:05:11,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">which means</font>

100
00:05:11,640 --> 00:05:13,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this patch of ground
was stained with blood.</font>

101
00:05:13,880 --> 00:05:15,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even though it's been wiped clean,</font>

102
00:05:15,880 --> 00:05:17,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the smell won't fade so easily.</font>

103
00:05:18,120 --> 00:05:18,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So,</font>

104
00:05:19,200 --> 00:05:20,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this is the murder scene?</font>

105
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:23,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't this a bit too casual?</font>

106
00:05:32,920 --> 00:05:33,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

107
00:05:34,400 --> 00:05:35,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you looking at?</font>

108
00:05:39,640 --> 00:05:40,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

109
00:05:41,520 --> 00:05:43,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could the crime scene</font>

110
00:05:43,840 --> 00:05:45,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">possibly be up there?</font>

111
00:05:46,560 --> 00:05:47,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No sound was heard.</font>

112
00:05:48,440 --> 00:05:50,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That means the victim
couldn't make a sound.</font>

113
00:05:51,040 --> 00:05:51,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And the blood</font>

114
00:05:52,200 --> 00:05:54,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">might have been absorbed
by something up there.</font>

115
00:05:56,280 --> 00:05:57,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From above,</font>

116
00:05:57,720 --> 00:05:59,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it dripped down to the floor.</font>

117
00:06:03,200 --> 00:06:04,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then they wiped it all clean</font>

118
00:06:04,960 --> 00:06:05,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and moved the body.</font>

119
00:06:07,920 --> 00:06:09,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need to check something on the body.</font>

120
00:06:10,960 --> 00:06:12,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just as I thought.</font>

121
00:06:12,960 --> 00:06:14,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan, wait for me.</font>

122
00:06:20,120 --> 00:06:20,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

123
00:06:22,840 --> 00:06:23,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What did you find?</font>

124
00:06:23,960 --> 00:06:25,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">People keep dying
at Prince Duan's Mansion.</font>

125
00:06:25,800 --> 00:06:27,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yet no one heard any cries for help.</font>

126
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:28,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, I think</font>

127
00:06:29,120 --> 00:06:30,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's not that the victims
didn't call out,</font>

128
00:06:31,280 --> 00:06:32,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but that they couldn't make a sound.</font>

129
00:06:43,680 --> 00:06:45,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If that's the cause of death,</font>

130
00:06:45,800 --> 00:06:46,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how was the victims' blood</font>

131
00:06:47,240 --> 00:06:48,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">completely drained?</font>

132
00:06:48,640 --> 00:06:49,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Afterward, the killer</font>

133
00:06:49,800 --> 00:06:51,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">used another method.</font>

134
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:53,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When the victim was barely alive,</font>

135
00:06:53,960 --> 00:06:55,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they swiftly drained all their blood.</font>

136
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:58,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They also destroyed the claw marks.</font>

137
00:06:58,960 --> 00:07:00,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's why we see</font>

138
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:01,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">each victim's wound</font>

139
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:02,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so gruesomely torn and bloody.</font>

140
00:07:04,080 --> 00:07:04,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What method?</font>

141
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:06,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A bird of prey.</font>

142
00:07:07,280 --> 00:07:08,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The bird's pecking</font>

143
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:10,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">obscured the wounds from the talons.</font>

144
00:07:10,720 --> 00:07:11,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At the same time,</font>

145
00:07:11,680 --> 00:07:13,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the talon wounds</font>

146
00:07:13,200 --> 00:07:15,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">also marred the peck marks left
by the bird.</font>

147
00:07:15,960 --> 00:07:17,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The two types of wounds overlapped,</font>

148
00:07:17,840 --> 00:07:19,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">which threw off our initial judgment.</font>

149
00:07:20,800 --> 00:07:22,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just re-examined the body,</font>

150
00:07:22,840 --> 00:07:24,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and indeed, on the corpse,</font>

151
00:07:24,240 --> 00:07:25,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I found partial pecking injuries.</font>

152
00:07:26,440 --> 00:07:27,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As expected of Qinglan.</font>

153
00:07:28,400 --> 00:07:29,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, our next lead</font>

154
00:07:29,640 --> 00:07:30,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is to find out what kind of creature</font>

155
00:07:30,680 --> 00:07:31,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">drained the blood.</font>

156
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:32,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly.</font>

157
00:07:33,560 --> 00:07:34,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go and share this good news</font>

158
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:35,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with the Prince right away.</font>

159
00:07:46,320 --> 00:07:47,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jinyi,</font>

160
00:07:47,960 --> 00:07:49,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">please eat something.</font>

161
00:07:51,040 --> 00:07:51,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is the Prince?</font>

162
00:07:52,200 --> 00:07:53,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Prince and Ms. Jun</font>

163
00:07:53,600 --> 00:07:54,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are investigating a case.</font>

164
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:56,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are your orders?</font>

165
00:07:56,320 --> 00:07:57,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can tell me.</font>

166
00:07:57,560 --> 00:07:58,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun Qinglan again.</font>

167
00:07:58,920 --> 00:07:59,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In truth, the Prince</font>

168
00:08:00,080 --> 00:08:01,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">cares for you quite a lot.</font>

169
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:03,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Before he left,</font>

170
00:08:03,440 --> 00:08:04,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he gave me special orders</font>

171
00:08:04,760 --> 00:08:06,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to look after your daily needs.</font>

172
00:08:06,760 --> 00:08:07,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get out.</font>

173
00:08:08,480 --> 00:08:09,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Leave.</font>

174
00:08:10,640 --> 00:08:11,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine. I'm leaving.</font>

175
00:08:12,280 --> 00:08:13,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Leaving now.</font>

176
00:08:13,720 --> 00:08:14,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm leaving.</font>

177
00:08:21,440 --> 00:08:22,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness!</font>

178
00:08:23,560 --> 00:08:24,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness!</font>

179
00:08:25,640 --> 00:08:26,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness!</font>

180
00:08:26,400 --> 00:08:26,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bad news!</font>

181
00:08:27,480 --> 00:08:28,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Something's wrong with Jinyi!</font>

182
00:08:32,040 --> 00:08:32,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stay back!</font>

183
00:08:32,920 --> 00:08:33,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go!</font>

184
00:08:34,200 --> 00:08:34,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Leave!</font>

185
00:08:35,840 --> 00:08:36,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone, out.</font>

186
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:40,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Leave.</font>

187
00:08:42,520 --> 00:08:43,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness, don't come closer.</font>

188
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:47,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Put down what you're holding.</font>

189
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:49,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

190
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:53,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My resolve was not strong enough.</font>

191
00:08:54,160 --> 00:08:56,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me cut off this filthy hair.</font>

192
00:08:56,080 --> 00:08:57,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Out of sight, out of mind.</font>

193
00:08:57,760 --> 00:08:59,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As Chief of the Shadow Guards,</font>

194
00:08:59,200 --> 00:09:00,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your resolve must be unshakable.</font>

195
00:09:01,720 --> 00:09:02,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at you now, weeping,</font>

196
00:09:02,640 --> 00:09:03,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">ready to end it all.</font>

197
00:09:04,640 --> 00:09:05,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you even respect yourself?</font>

198
00:09:11,520 --> 00:09:13,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've asked Physician Liu
to search for a cure.</font>

199
00:09:18,120 --> 00:09:18,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I give you my word:</font>

200
00:09:19,640 --> 00:09:20,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will do everything in my power</font>

201
00:09:21,600 --> 00:09:23,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to find a way to help you recover.</font>

202
00:09:33,240 --> 00:09:33,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Jun.</font>

203
00:09:41,920 --> 00:09:42,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

204
00:09:43,880 --> 00:09:44,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

205
00:09:44,680 --> 00:09:46,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Forgive me for failing to protect you.</font>

206
00:09:47,440 --> 00:09:48,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, no, don't do this.</font>

207
00:09:49,680 --> 00:09:50,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please, you mustn't do this.</font>

208
00:09:59,480 --> 00:10:00,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's the matter?</font>

209
00:10:00,920 --> 00:10:01,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why has our dear sunflower</font>

210
00:10:01,600 --> 00:10:02,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">become such a bitter gourd?</font>

211
00:10:03,360 --> 00:10:04,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did Li Congyao bully you?</font>

212
00:10:05,040 --> 00:10:05,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

213
00:10:06,480 --> 00:10:07,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was just thinking.</font>

214
00:10:08,320 --> 00:10:10,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I first took
the Xizhao Princess case,</font>

215
00:10:10,600 --> 00:10:12,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it was to get close to Changle
and save my brother.</font>

216
00:10:13,200 --> 00:10:13,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why is it now</font>

217
00:10:14,280 --> 00:10:16,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that I've gone
against my original purpose</font>

218
00:10:16,760 --> 00:10:17,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and drifted further away?</font>

219
00:10:17,960 --> 00:10:19,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't you say that three years ago,</font>

220
00:10:19,640 --> 00:10:21,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you saw him
in Princess Changle's carriage?</font>

221
00:10:21,440 --> 00:10:22,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So much time has passed already.</font>

222
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:23,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What if he's no longer</font>

223
00:10:24,200 --> 00:10:25,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">at Princess Changle's Mansion?</font>

224
00:10:25,720 --> 00:10:26,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

225
00:10:26,960 --> 00:10:27,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's still there.</font>

226
00:10:27,920 --> 00:10:28,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The fact that he's lasted so long</font>

227
00:10:28,640 --> 00:10:29,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">at Princess Changle's Mansion</font>

228
00:10:30,080 --> 00:10:31,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">means he knows how to keep himself safe.</font>

229
00:10:31,720 --> 00:10:32,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once this case is closed,</font>

230
00:10:32,680 --> 00:10:33,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll ask Prince Duan to release you</font>

231
00:10:33,760 --> 00:10:34,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and take you away from here.</font>

232
00:10:34,640 --> 00:10:35,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then we'll find a way
to save your brother.</font>

233
00:10:36,400 --> 00:10:37,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Jiang.</font>

234
00:10:37,640 --> 00:10:39,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our affairs are none of your concern.</font>

235
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:40,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief,</font>

236
00:10:41,640 --> 00:10:43,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">please inform the Prince
of the latest developments.</font>

237
00:10:44,200 --> 00:10:45,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've just summoned everyone
from the mansion.</font>

238
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:47,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're all waiting for my inquiry.</font>

239
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:48,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Jun.</font>

240
00:10:48,960 --> 00:10:49,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't you just call me...</font>

241
00:10:49,480 --> 00:10:49,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

242
00:10:52,960 --> 00:10:54,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I heard her mention her brother.</font>

243
00:10:54,680 --> 00:10:55,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's that all about?</font>

244
00:10:57,520 --> 00:10:58,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What else do you know?</font>

245
00:10:59,720 --> 00:11:00,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's nonsense.</font>

246
00:11:01,520 --> 00:11:01,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You...</font>

247
00:11:02,080 --> 00:11:03,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You must be hearing things.</font>

248
00:11:07,680 --> 00:11:09,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you heard
about the White-Haired Demoness</font>

249
00:11:09,720 --> 00:11:10,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">at Prince Duan's Mansion?</font>

250
00:11:10,880 --> 00:11:11,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

251
00:11:12,400 --> 00:11:13,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I saw it with my own eyes.</font>

252
00:11:13,680 --> 00:11:14,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was terrifying.</font>

253
00:11:16,360 --> 00:11:17,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What exactly happened?</font>

254
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:19,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Her hair all wild, snarling and clawing,</font>

255
00:11:19,480 --> 00:11:20,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she'd bite anyone in sight.</font>

256
00:11:21,240 --> 00:11:22,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Utterly ferocious.</font>

257
00:11:22,560 --> 00:11:23,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That horrifying?</font>

258
00:11:23,520 --> 00:11:24,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Absolutely.</font>

259
00:11:25,240 --> 00:11:26,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's old news now.</font>

260
00:11:28,440 --> 00:11:30,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've got something even more explosive.</font>

261
00:11:30,480 --> 00:11:31,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's about a romantic scandal</font>

262
00:11:31,720 --> 00:11:34,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">involving Princess Changle.</font>

263
00:11:35,760 --> 00:11:36,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A romantic scandal?</font>

264
00:11:38,160 --> 00:11:39,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Do tell.
- Spill it.</font>

265
00:11:39,600 --> 00:11:41,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The story goes back then...</font>

266
00:11:44,140 --> 00:11:47,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Princess Changle's Mansion]</font>

267
00:11:49,440 --> 00:11:50,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

268
00:11:50,520 --> 00:11:52,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">word just came from the palace:</font>

269
00:11:52,640 --> 00:11:55,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His Majesty summons you at once.</font>

270
00:11:57,200 --> 00:11:59,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What does my brother want so suddenly?</font>

271
00:11:59,720 --> 00:12:00,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well...</font>

272
00:12:03,160 --> 00:12:03,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Perfect timing.</font>

273
00:12:04,480 --> 00:12:05,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

274
00:12:08,160 --> 00:12:10,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty,
you must seek justice for me.</font>

275
00:12:10,520 --> 00:12:11,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Yufan, in broad daylight,</font>

276
00:12:11,920 --> 00:12:13,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">dared to barge into my mansion.</font>

277
00:12:13,560 --> 00:12:14,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

278
00:12:21,720 --> 00:12:22,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty,</font>

279
00:12:23,360 --> 00:12:25,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the commoners pale
at the mere mention of Prince Duan,</font>

280
00:12:25,480 --> 00:12:26,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">calling him a blood-sucking demon.</font>

281
00:12:27,160 --> 00:12:28,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could you allow him
into the Imperial Palace?</font>

282
00:12:30,440 --> 00:12:32,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,
rather than repeating hearsay</font>

283
00:12:33,120 --> 00:12:34,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to stir up needless fear,</font>

284
00:12:35,520 --> 00:12:37,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you should solve
the problem at hand first.</font>

285
00:12:39,280 --> 00:12:40,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,
do you recognize these two?</font>

286
00:12:44,920 --> 00:12:46,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am of noble standing.</font>

287
00:12:47,040 --> 00:12:49,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How would I know
such a down-and-out scholar</font>

288
00:12:49,160 --> 00:12:50,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and a common merchant?</font>

289
00:12:51,640 --> 00:12:52,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty, please trust me.</font>

290
00:12:54,080 --> 00:12:54,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am Cheng Shangyan,</font>

291
00:12:55,240 --> 00:12:58,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">owner of Yanjing's Shuili Cloth Shop.</font>

292
00:12:58,560 --> 00:13:00,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My son was Cheng Linlin, Top Scholar</font>

293
00:13:00,720 --> 00:13:01,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">from last year's Imperial Examination.</font>

294
00:13:02,400 --> 00:13:03,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His great success</font>

295
00:13:03,720 --> 00:13:05,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was a tremendous joy for us.</font>

296
00:13:05,960 --> 00:13:06,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yet, on the night</font>

297
00:13:07,280 --> 00:13:09,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">before his palace award ceremony,</font>

298
00:13:09,920 --> 00:13:10,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my son</font>

299
00:13:11,280 --> 00:13:13,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">hanged himself.</font>

300
00:13:14,160 --> 00:13:16,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This past year,</font>

301
00:13:16,560 --> 00:13:17,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I asked around everywhere</font>

302
00:13:18,800 --> 00:13:21,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and finally uncovered
why my son took his own life.</font>

303
00:13:22,600 --> 00:13:23,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was</font>

304
00:13:25,360 --> 00:13:26,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because Princess Changle</font>

305
00:13:26,920 --> 00:13:28,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">drove him to his death.</font>

306
00:13:28,960 --> 00:13:30,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Those are just empty words.</font>

307
00:13:30,520 --> 00:13:32,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you know
that slandering the imperial family</font>

308
00:13:32,280 --> 00:13:33,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is punishable by death?</font>

309
00:13:33,720 --> 00:13:34,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty,</font>

310
00:13:34,760 --> 00:13:35,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am the proof.</font>

311
00:13:36,560 --> 00:13:38,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am also a victim in this matter.</font>

312
00:13:39,120 --> 00:13:41,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That night,
to celebrate Cheng's success,</font>

313
00:13:41,800 --> 00:13:43,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we went to Joyous Teahouse for tea.</font>

314
00:13:43,800 --> 00:13:45,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But on our way back,</font>

315
00:13:45,720 --> 00:13:47,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we were knocked out and taken
to Princess Changle's Mansion.</font>

316
00:13:48,400 --> 00:13:50,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Princess then forced us</font>

317
00:13:50,560 --> 00:13:51,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to compose poems and paint for her.</font>

318
00:13:52,840 --> 00:13:54,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cheng, a refined scholar,</font>

319
00:13:54,960 --> 00:13:55,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">could not bear such humiliation.</font>

320
00:13:56,080 --> 00:13:57,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He passed away with deep resentment.</font>

321
00:13:57,560 --> 00:13:58,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He left behind this blood letter.</font>

322
00:13:59,720 --> 00:14:01,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I feared the Princess's revenge,</font>

323
00:14:01,840 --> 00:14:03,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so I've been in hiding ever since,</font>

324
00:14:03,920 --> 00:14:05,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">tormented by my own conscience.</font>

325
00:14:05,640 --> 00:14:06,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today,</font>

326
00:14:06,800 --> 00:14:08,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am here to atone for my sins.</font>

327
00:14:12,200 --> 00:14:12,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty,</font>

328
00:14:13,480 --> 00:14:15,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">do not trust this man's words.</font>

329
00:14:15,600 --> 00:14:17,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All of this can be forged.</font>

330
00:14:18,600 --> 00:14:19,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It must be Prince Duan.</font>

331
00:14:20,440 --> 00:14:21,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He wants to use this chance</font>

332
00:14:22,360 --> 00:14:24,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to drive a wedge between us.</font>

333
00:14:39,080 --> 00:14:39,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then take a look at this.</font>

334
00:14:47,840 --> 00:14:50,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Yufan accuses me of assault?</font>

335
00:14:52,000 --> 00:14:53,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's framing me!</font>

336
00:14:54,400 --> 00:14:54,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Changle,</font>

337
00:14:56,040 --> 00:14:57,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the case of Cheng Linlin back then</font>

338
00:14:57,200 --> 00:14:59,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">caused a huge uproar in Yanjing.</font>

339
00:15:00,200 --> 00:15:01,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now, the evidence is conclusive,</font>

340
00:15:02,120 --> 00:15:03,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and even senior officials
are impeaching you.</font>

341
00:15:05,120 --> 00:15:06,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Many commoners have gathered</font>

342
00:15:06,320 --> 00:15:07,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">at the Imperial City gates to protest.</font>

343
00:15:08,960 --> 00:15:10,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone's equal before the law.</font>

344
00:15:11,600 --> 00:15:13,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I must give the people an explanation.</font>

345
00:15:14,080 --> 00:15:14,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty,</font>

346
00:15:15,400 --> 00:15:16,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have been wronged.</font>

347
00:15:17,440 --> 00:15:19,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They are deliberately framing me.</font>

348
00:15:19,640 --> 00:15:20,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty,</font>

349
00:15:20,720 --> 00:15:22,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Princess Changle has long
conducted herself improperly.</font>

350
00:15:22,840 --> 00:15:24,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We must give the Cheng family an answer,</font>

351
00:15:25,800 --> 00:15:27,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so the dead can rest in peace,</font>

352
00:15:28,080 --> 00:15:29,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the living can find solace.</font>

353
00:15:29,560 --> 00:15:32,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty,
please grant my son justice.</font>

354
00:15:33,800 --> 00:15:34,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then, in your view,</font>

355
00:15:35,600 --> 00:15:37,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how should this matter be handled?</font>

356
00:15:37,760 --> 00:15:38,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Perhaps,</font>

357
00:15:39,520 --> 00:15:40,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we could send Princess Changle</font>

358
00:15:40,600 --> 00:15:42,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to Qingping Temple
for a period of reflection.</font>

359
00:15:43,120 --> 00:15:44,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For one, she can repent before Buddha.</font>

360
00:15:45,920 --> 00:15:46,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For another,</font>

361
00:15:46,720 --> 00:15:48,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it will also comfort
Cheng Linlin's spirit in heaven.</font>

362
00:15:49,280 --> 00:15:51,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao, how dare you confine me?</font>

363
00:15:52,480 --> 00:15:53,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty,</font>

364
00:15:54,280 --> 00:15:55,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am your elder sister!</font>

365
00:15:56,320 --> 00:15:57,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you truly heed slanderous advice</font>

366
00:15:57,440 --> 00:15:58,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and punish me for it,</font>

367
00:15:58,600 --> 00:16:00,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it would be a slap in the face
to the imperial family.</font>

368
00:16:01,040 --> 00:16:01,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At this moment,</font>

369
00:16:01,880 --> 00:16:04,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you suddenly remember you are
His Majesty's elder sister?</font>

370
00:16:05,320 --> 00:16:06,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As a princess of the realm,</font>

371
00:16:08,040 --> 00:16:09,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">should you not set an example
with your conduct?</font>

372
00:16:11,400 --> 00:16:12,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This matter</font>

373
00:16:12,360 --> 00:16:13,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is settled.</font>

374
00:16:14,000 --> 00:16:15,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As for Cheng Linlin,</font>

375
00:16:16,000 --> 00:16:18,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he shall be posthumously conferred
the title of Rank-III Hanlin Official.</font>

376
00:16:19,040 --> 00:16:20,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty, you're wise.</font>

377
00:16:20,640 --> 00:16:22,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I kowtow in gratitude, Your Majesty.</font>

378
00:16:39,440 --> 00:16:40,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Changle,</font>

379
00:16:41,080 --> 00:16:41,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">sorry about this.</font>

380
00:16:43,160 --> 00:16:44,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do not make such a mistake again.</font>

381
00:16:46,640 --> 00:16:48,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you do not trust me, so be it.</font>

382
00:16:49,440 --> 00:16:50,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As a princess of this realm,</font>

383
00:16:51,600 --> 00:16:53,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will never bring you further trouble.</font>

384
00:16:56,880 --> 00:16:57,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guards!</font>

385
00:16:57,840 --> 00:16:59,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Escort the princess to Qingping Temple.</font>

386
00:17:20,970 --> 00:17:22,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

387
00:17:23,850 --> 00:17:25,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

388
00:17:25,510 --> 00:17:28,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

389
00:17:29,440 --> 00:17:33,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

390
00:17:34,120 --> 00:17:37,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

391
00:17:38,100 --> 00:17:42,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

392
00:17:42,620 --> 00:17:46,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

393
00:17:46,960 --> 00:17:52,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

394
00:17:55,090 --> 00:17:59,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

395
00:17:59,760 --> 00:18:03,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

396
00:18:03,810 --> 00:18:08,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

397
00:18:08,360 --> 00:18:11,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

398
00:18:12,340 --> 00:18:16,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

399
00:18:16,940 --> 00:18:20,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
